      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get that, i really do. but \"creating meaning\" feels like such a chore when you're already exhausted. it feels like trying to build a sandcastle right before the tide comes in. if the end result is always just... nothing, then why bother with the building part at all? it just seems like a lot of unnecessary effort for a joke that isn't even funny.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
